提交；也可返回列表。\",\n814:         \"success_state\": \"303 返回首页，新记录出现在所选归类，GET /api/bookmarks/{id} 返回同一原始 URL；SQLite 行已持久化。\"\n815:       },\n816:       {\n817:         \"acceptance_ids\": [\n818:           \"A03\"\n819:         ],\n820:         \"action\": \"不另选归类直接保存；首启查看预置归类。\",\n821:         \"design_basis\": \"场景 workflow 3：未经整理的链接先进入默认归类，之后再移动；成熟产品普遍提供未被整理收件区。\",\n822:         \"entry\": \"首页保存表单的 category 字段（默认「未整理」）与侧栏/归类页的预置归类列表。\",\n823:         \"failure\": \"默认归类缺失或写入失败时返回明确错误页或 JSON 错误，不伪装成功。\",\n824:         \"feature_id\": \"F02\",\n825:         \"navigation\": \"303 到首页或未整理归类视图。\",\n826:         \"recovery\": \"重试保存；应用启动时在事务中补齐预置归类。\",\n827:         \"success_state\": \"记录的 category_id 为默认「未整理」，可在 /?category=未整理 看到；“未整理”“待购”“家居改造”“以后看看”均可见。\"\n828:       },\n829:       {\n830:         \"acceptance_ids\": [\n831:           \"A04\"\n832:         ],\n833:         \"action\": \"在真实表单提交 name 新建/重命名，提交 category_id 删除；删除默认归类被拒绝。\",\n834:         \"design_basis\": \"场景验收 3 与 workflow 2：用户可新建归类并把记录放入合适位置；源包没有 collections，属目标新设计。\",\n835:         \"entry\": \"首页 a[data-testid=category-manager] 进入 /categories；该页含 category-create-form、category-rename-\n836: form、category-delete-form。\",\n837:         \"error_branch_ids\": [\n838:           \"html.category_create.name.omitted\",\n839:           \"html.category_create.name.empty\",\n840:           \"html.category_create.name.whitespace\",\n841:           \"html.category_create.name.overlong_121\",\n842:           \"html.category_rename.name.omitted\",\n843:           \"html.category_rename.name.empty\",\n844:           \"html.category_rename.name.whitespace\",\n845:           \"html.category_rename.name.overlong_121\",\n846:           \"json.category_create.name.omitted\",\n847:           \"json.category_create.name.empty\",\n848:           \"json.category_create.name.whitespace\",\n849:           \"json.category_create.name.overlong_121\",\n850:           \"json.category_create.name.null\",\n851:           \"json.category_rename.name.omitted\",\n852:           \"json.category_rename.name.empty\",\n853:           \"json.category_rename.name.whitespace\",\n854:           \"json.category_rename.name.overlong_121\",\n855:           \"json.category_rename.name.null\"\n856:         ],\n857:         \"failure\": \"重名 409 duplicate_category、空名/超长 400 invalid_name、默认归类 400 protected_category；页面显示 form-error\n858: 且数据不变。\",\n859:         \"feature_id\": \"F03\",\n860:         \"navigation\": \"创建/重命名/删除成功后 303 到 /categories。\",\n861:         \"recovery\": \"保留已填 name/category_id 并允许改正或选择其他归类；可返回 /categories 重试。\",\n862:         \"success_state\": \"303 到 /categories；新建/重命名可见且计数正确；删除归类后其活动与软删除记录都迁回「未整理」，软删记录仍可恢复。\"\n863:       },\n864:       {\n865:         \"acceptance_ids\": [\n866:           \"A05\",\n867:           \"A12\"\n868:         ],\n869:         \"action\": \"选择目标归类（API 归类 ID）并提交；HTML 适配器把 ID 翻译为归类名后调用现有 move 服务。\",\n870:         \"design_basis\": \"场景验收 3 与 workflow 3：记录可在归类之间移动，重新打开后仍保持新归属。\",\n871:         \"entry\": \"每条 tr[data-testid=record-row] 内的 form[data-testid=record-move-form]，含 input record_id 与 select\n872: name=category_id。\",\n873:         \"error_branch_ids\": [\n874:           \"html.bookmark_save.category.empty\",\n875:           \"html.bookmark_save.category.whitespace\",\n876:           \"html.bookmark_save.category.overlong_121\",\n877:           \"html.bookmark_move.category_id.omitted\",\n878:           \"html.bookmark_move.category_id.empty\",\n879:           \"html.bookmark_move.category_id.unknown_id\",\n880:           \"json.bookmark_save.category.empty\",\n881:           \"json.bookmark_save.category.whitespace\",\n882:           \"json.bookmark_save.category.overlong_121\",\n883:           \"json.bookmark_move.category.empty\",\n884:           \"json.bookmark_move.category.whitespace\",\n885:           \"json.bookmark_move.category.overlong_121\",\n886:           \"json.bookmark_move.category.omitted\",\n887:           \"json.bookmark_move.category.null\"\n888:         ],\n889:         \"failure\": \"空/超长/非法归类 400 invalid_category，未知 record_id 404 not_found；不移动、不写入。\",\n890:         \"feature_id\": \"F04\",\n891:         \"navigation\": \"成功后 303 到 /?category=<目标归类> 或来源视图。\",\n892:         \"recovery\": \"保留选择并显示 form-error；用户改选有效归类或返回列表重试。\",\n893:         \"success_state\": \"303 回列表；记录离开原归类并出现在目标归类，JSON 的 category 与持久化结果一致。\"\n894:       },\n895:       {\n896:         \"acceptance_ids\": [\n897:           \"A06\"\n898:         ],\n899:         \"action\": \"点击归类链接或从搜索表单选择归类并查看列表。\",\n900:         \"design_basis\": \"场景验收 4：用户通过归类浏览找回记录；来源标签计数被调整为按归类聚合。\",\n901:         \"entry\": \"首页侧栏 [data-testid=category-count][data-category-id] 与归类链接；/categories 同显计数；GET /?category=<name>。\",\n902:         \"failure\": \"未知归类返回空结果而非 5xx；计数查询失败显示错误页。\",\n903:         \"feature_id\": \"F05\",\n904:         \"navigation\": \"GET /?category=... 或 GET /categories；无记录时显示明确空状态。\",\n905:         \"recovery\": \"选择其他归类或清空筛选。\",\n906:         \"success_state\": \"页面只列该归类活动记录；HTML count 与 JSON count 都等于活动（未软删）记录数；移动、删除、恢复后仍一致。\"\n907:       },\n908:       {\n909:         \"acceptance_ids\": [\n910:           \"A07\"\n911:         ],\n912:         \"action\": \"选择归类、输入关键字并提交。\",\n913:         \"design_basis\": \"场景验收 4：用户凭记得的关键字找回已存链接；来源仅搜标题，目标扩展到可识别来源的字段。\",\n914:         \"entry\": \"首页 form[data-testid=category-search-form]，字段 category（归类名）与 q；action 为 GET /。\",\n915:         \"failure\": \"无匹配不是错误（200 + 空结果）；非法请求返回可读错误且不写入。\",\n916:         \"feature_id\": \"F06\",\n917:         \"navigation\": \"GET /?category=...&q=...，同一页面更新结果。\",\n918:         \"recovery\": \"修改 q 或切换归类重新提交；清空 q 恢复归类浏览。\",\n919:         \"success_state\": \"URL 与表单保留 category 与 q；页面显示所选归类、保留查询和匹配行；同一关键字在两个归类分别命中各自记录；无匹配显示明确空结果；JSON 返回匹配集。\"\n920:       },\n921:       {\n922:         \"acceptance_ids\": [\n923:           \"A08\"\n924:         ],\n925:         \"action\": \"用户点击打开链接。\",\n926:         \"design_basis\": \"场景验收 2 与 workflow 5：打开记录即回到保存时的外部网页，库只